WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.836
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:01.106 --> 00:03.442
[♪ theme song playing]

3
00:03.525 --> 00:04.651
PARK MINJAE'S LIST

4
00:04.735 --> 00:06.028
START DATING...

5
00:36.725 --> 00:41.063
BETWEEN STEPS

6
00:41.688 --> 00:43.940
CHARACTERS, PLACES, ORGANIZATIONS, AND EVENTS IN THIS DRAMA ARE FICTITIOUS

7
00:44.024 --> 00:45.651
THIS DRAMA CONTAINS SENSITIVE CONTENT

8
00:47.027 --> 00:49.279
EPISODE 4

9
01:24.314 --> 01:25.315
[door lock chimes]

10
01:27.859 --> 01:28.860
Oh...

11
01:44.793 --> 01:45.794
[sniffles]

12
01:47.337 --> 01:48.880
[door opens]

13
01:52.259 --> 01:53.552
Hey, Lim Youjin.

14
01:54.302 --> 01:57.264
Do you know what time it is? Why the hell are you still in bed?

15
01:57.347 --> 01:58.765
Are you going to get up or not?

16
02:00.016 --> 02:01.184
Hey, you little brat.

17
02:01.768 --> 02:03.687
When your mother is making breakfast,

18
02:03.770 --> 02:08.024
the least you can do is get up on time and be at the table

19
02:08.108 --> 02:11.361
if you can't help her out, okay?

20
02:11.445 --> 02:12.446
[loudly] Get up now!

21
02:14.740 --> 02:16.199
Hey, are you crying?

22
02:20.036 --> 02:21.872
What's wrong? Are you sick?

23
02:23.707 --> 02:24.791
[Youjin whimpers]

24
02:26.168 --> 02:27.669
You do feel a little warm.

25
02:29.087 --> 02:31.715
Mom! I think she has a fever.

26
02:38.346 --> 02:39.347
[sighs]

27
02:41.641 --> 02:42.642
Hey.

28
02:43.477 --> 02:44.478
[Minjae] Yes?

29
02:44.561 --> 02:46.188
It's past 9 a.m. now.

30
02:46.271 --> 02:47.481
What?

31
02:48.064 --> 02:52.152
It's past 9 a.m., and Lim Youjin still isn't here.

32
02:53.236 --> 02:54.237
She's late.

33
02:55.572 --> 02:56.573
Oh...

34
02:58.909 --> 03:00.577
She's late, right?

35
03:04.414 --> 03:09.169
Is this lab pretty flexible about what time people come in?

36
03:09.252 --> 03:12.130
Is it okay to come in at 10 or 11? I'm just curious.

37
03:12.214 --> 03:13.882
No, we start at 9 a.m.

38
03:13.965 --> 03:15.008
[Sejin] Ah...

39
03:15.091 --> 03:17.511
I knew it. And yet she hasn't arrived.

40
03:18.678 --> 03:20.847
She's not late. It's just turned 9 a.m.

41
03:22.390 --> 03:23.809
Maybe the traffic's bad.

42
03:23.892 --> 03:26.895
If the traffic's bad, she should've left earlier, right?

43
03:26.978 --> 03:28.897
She's keeping us waiting for our meeting.

44
03:30.065 --> 03:34.236
[clears throat] Then, should I call her?

45
03:35.111 --> 03:36.196
And see where she is?

46
03:37.072 --> 03:38.615
Sure, give her a call.

47
03:38.698 --> 03:40.033
[Sejin] All right, got it.

48
03:41.993 --> 03:44.871
Actually, no, Hangyeol, could you call her and ask where she is?

49
03:45.455 --> 03:46.456
[Hangyeol sighs softly]

50
03:46.540 --> 03:48.166
She'll get here when she gets here.

51
03:48.250 --> 03:50.126
As if rushing her will make a difference.

52
03:52.379 --> 03:54.714
See? She came.

53
03:54.798 --> 03:56.508
[Youjin] I'm sorry I'm late.

54
03:57.008 --> 03:58.802
[Minjae] Let's try to get to work on time, okay?

55
04:01.388 --> 04:04.015
Now that Youjin is here, let's start the meeting.

56
04:05.183 --> 04:08.019
Did you all see the email Sejin sent?

57
04:08.103 --> 04:09.271
-Yes. -Yes.

58
04:10.105 --> 04:13.233
[Minjae] Sejin, how did you find the time to put this all together?

59
04:13.316 --> 04:16.695
It's just... I just did it at home.

60
04:16.778 --> 04:19.072
It's only a draft, so it's pretty rough.

61
04:19.155 --> 04:20.156
[Minjae] No, it's not rough.

62
04:21.116 --> 04:23.159
You have really good instincts.

63
04:23.243 --> 04:25.203
This is right on point. Great job.

64
04:25.287 --> 04:26.454
It's nothing.

65
04:26.538 --> 04:30.166
No, honestly, I was a bit surprised too. You did a great job.

66
04:30.250 --> 04:33.086
-[Minjae] Yeah. -We've got a really talented rookie.

67
04:33.169 --> 04:36.756
But raising the TRL within a short timeframe won't be easy.

68
04:36.840 --> 04:40.552
Either way, we'll need to make a finite element analysis graph.

69
04:41.761 --> 04:43.972
So let's start thinking about our approach.

70
04:44.055 --> 04:45.932
Who reviews the proposal, by the way?

71
04:46.808 --> 04:49.477
-Well, I suppose mostly senior members. -[Minjae] Yeah.

72
04:49.561 --> 04:52.105
[Taeho] We need a trick here. [inhales sharply]

73
04:52.188 --> 04:55.400
The reviewers can't possibly get through all 300, 400 pages anyway.

74
04:55.984 --> 04:59.779
So we need to make graphs that pop, okay?

75
04:59.863 --> 05:01.865
-[Minjae] Yeah. -[Taeho] With lots of color.

76
05:01.948 --> 05:03.783
The key is to make it visually engaging.

77
05:03.867 --> 05:05.368
Right, then, I'll use RecurDyn--

78
05:05.452 --> 05:07.037
I can do that.

79
05:14.294 --> 05:18.423
You don't know how to use RecurDyn, Ms. Lim.

80
05:20.258 --> 05:21.468
Um...

81
05:21.551 --> 05:24.262
Well, I've used Illustrator before, for fashion design.

82
05:24.846 --> 05:27.098
-[Taeho] Hmm. -[Sejin] I'd say they're different.

83
05:27.182 --> 05:29.601
How are they different? They're similar, Mr. Kim.

84
05:30.977 --> 05:33.229
Youjin, do you think you can do it?

85
05:35.023 --> 05:36.024
Yes.

86
05:36.107 --> 05:38.568
All right. If you think you can do it, give it a try.

87
05:38.652 --> 05:41.404
Feel free to ask us anytime if you have any questions.

88
05:41.488 --> 05:42.489
Okay.

89
05:43.073 --> 05:46.534
[Taeho] By the way, there's something that's been bothering me.

90
05:46.618 --> 05:48.578
-Uh... -[Minjae] Mmm... Sure, what is it?

91
05:48.662 --> 05:50.622
What are those sneakers?

92
05:50.705 --> 05:52.290
I haven't seen them before.

93
05:52.374 --> 05:53.375
[Minjae] These?

94
05:53.458 --> 05:56.962
Wait, pink? Men's sneakers come in pink too?

95
05:57.045 --> 05:59.047
-Did you buy them? -[Taeho chuckles]

96
05:59.130 --> 06:01.299
They were a birthday gift.

97
06:01.383 --> 06:02.592
Youjin gave them to me.

98
06:03.593 --> 06:07.889
Unlike you guys, who didn't get your esteemed senior a cookie crumb.

99
06:07.973 --> 06:13.520
Anyway, our rookies are cute, hardworking, and sweet. I love it.

100
06:13.603 --> 06:15.772
[Taeho] Ah... It's a birthday gift.

101
06:16.272 --> 06:19.734
Wow, but that's really nice of her. I'm moved.

102
06:19.818 --> 06:20.819
-I know, right? -Yeah.

103
06:20.902 --> 06:23.363
No wonder. Those sneakers are growing on me.

104
06:23.446 --> 06:24.447
[Taeho] Yeah.

105
06:24.531 --> 06:26.741
[Hangyeol] Seriously, that was such a good choice.

106
06:26.825 --> 06:28.910
-[Minjae] Pretty cute, right? -Pink is a man's color.

107
06:28.994 --> 06:30.704
-Great choice, Youjin. -[Minjae] They're nice.

108
06:30.787 --> 06:33.456
[Sejin] By the way, Minjae, your prosthetic leg is titanium, right?

109
06:33.540 --> 06:35.583
[Minjae] Ah... Yeah.

110
06:36.167 --> 06:39.004
Titanium is lightweight and strong.

111
06:39.087 --> 06:43.049
Actually, I came across this paper on a new material.

112
06:43.133 --> 06:46.636
Really? If you come across anything like that, just send it my way.

113
06:46.720 --> 06:47.929
-[Sejin] Okay. -[Minjae] Yeah.

114
06:48.013 --> 06:50.306
[inhales] Anyway, Youjin, thanks for these.

115
06:51.015 --> 06:52.016
Thank you.

116
06:56.479 --> 06:58.481
[indistinct chatter]

117
07:14.164 --> 07:15.165
[Minjae] Hey.

118
07:16.750 --> 07:18.209
Why were you late today?

119
07:19.919 --> 07:20.920
Um...

120
07:21.796 --> 07:23.173
I wasn't feeling well.

121
07:23.840 --> 07:26.426
My head was hurting, and my stomach was hurting too.

122
07:27.051 --> 07:28.303
[Minjae] Did you go to the doctor?

123
07:29.471 --> 07:32.307
No, I took some medicine, and I got better.

124
07:32.390 --> 07:33.391
[Minjae] Hmm.

125
07:33.892 --> 07:35.393
You do look a little puffy.

126
07:36.060 --> 07:38.021
-No, I'm not. -[Minjae] Never mind, then.

127
07:41.232 --> 07:42.942
Well, you weren't feeling well,

128
07:44.694 --> 07:46.488
so I can't be too hard on you for that.

129
07:46.571 --> 07:48.990
But we were supposed to meet at 9 a.m. today,

130
07:49.073 --> 07:51.951
and you shouldn't have kept everyone waiting.

131
07:53.077 --> 07:54.078
Right?

132
07:54.621 --> 07:58.082
As a newbie, the least you could do was show up early and be prepared.

133
08:00.919 --> 08:01.920
Don't be late.

134
08:02.879 --> 08:04.756
-[Minjae sighs] -I'm sorry.

135
08:07.217 --> 08:08.218
What?

136
08:08.301 --> 08:09.844
I have something to tell you.

137
08:11.429 --> 08:12.430
[Minjae] What is it?

138
08:14.182 --> 08:16.643
Can we step outside for a second?

139
08:18.436 --> 08:19.521
You can tell me here.

140
08:22.273 --> 08:23.733
[Youjin] It's kind of personal.

141
08:24.984 --> 08:28.780
Do we have anything personal to talk about?

142
08:29.614 --> 08:32.325
Well, it's not like it's some big secret, is it? [chuckles awkwardly]

143
08:32.867 --> 08:34.994
Just tell me. I'm curious.

144
08:39.624 --> 08:40.625
[Youjin sighs softly]

145
08:46.506 --> 08:49.425
-Do you really want me to say it here? -Yeah, go ahead.

146
08:50.093 --> 08:51.261
Why not?

147
08:52.011 --> 08:53.012
[sighs]

148
08:56.975 --> 08:58.643
What I did that day was wrong.

149
08:59.477 --> 09:01.521
Wrong? What was wrong?

150
09:02.480 --> 09:03.773
[♪ pensive music playing]

151
09:03.857 --> 09:05.567
I was in the wrong from the start.

152
09:06.776 --> 09:08.862
I shouldn't have shown up unannounced,

153
09:10.405 --> 09:12.740
and I shouldn't have given you those shoes either.

154
09:16.119 --> 09:20.582
I just couldn't believe it at the time, so I wanted to see it for myself.

155
09:24.043 --> 09:25.712
And I just left like that...

156
09:27.714 --> 09:30.508
because I was so caught off guard I didn't know what to do.

157
09:34.554 --> 09:37.056
I'm sorry I hurt you like that.

158
09:39.184 --> 09:41.144
[Minjae] Then you have nothing to apologize for.

159
09:42.687 --> 09:44.189
I wasn't hurt.

160
09:47.525 --> 09:49.485
Actually, I'm the one who should apologize.

161
09:51.154 --> 09:56.326
For not being the person you thought I was.

162
09:57.368 --> 10:01.497
And that made you sad, caught you off guard, and made you angry.

163
10:04.125 --> 10:05.168
I'm sorry.

164
10:11.591 --> 10:14.928
Now that we've both apologized, why don't we call it a day a little early?

165
10:15.511 --> 10:16.888
-Sejin! -[Sejin] Yes?

166
10:18.139 --> 10:20.892
[Minjae] Mmm... If you're pretty much done, you can head home now.

167
10:21.768 --> 10:24.020
[Sejin] Okay. I was about to leave, actually.

168
10:24.812 --> 10:26.064
[Minjae] Good work, everyone.

169
10:26.856 --> 10:27.941
Good work today.

170
10:28.608 --> 10:29.859
See you tomorrow.

171
10:29.943 --> 10:31.945
[♪ music stops]

172
10:34.072 --> 10:35.114
[door opens]

173
10:36.741 --> 10:37.742
[door closes]

174
10:47.168 --> 10:48.169
[groans]

175
10:49.796 --> 10:51.005
Hey...

176
10:52.632 --> 10:54.008
When you left earlier...

177
10:55.009 --> 10:56.469
When you left the lab earlier...

178
10:56.970 --> 11:00.473
-[Sejin] Yes. -Was Youjin crying?

179
11:02.809 --> 11:04.852
I mean, did she look like she was?

180
11:06.479 --> 11:08.147
She didn't look like she was crying, but...

181
11:08.231 --> 11:09.232
[Minjae] Yes.

182
11:09.774 --> 11:10.817
She seemed...

183
11:12.944 --> 11:14.570
a bit pissed off.

184
11:16.072 --> 11:17.073
[sighs in frustration]

185
11:27.041 --> 11:28.042
[grunts softly]

186
11:33.715 --> 11:35.717
[pills rattling]

187
11:58.448 --> 11:59.741
By the way...

188
12:03.286 --> 12:05.413
What was Lim Youjin talking about earlier?

189
12:07.582 --> 12:09.292
-What? -Did something happen?

190
12:11.419 --> 12:12.420
Oh...

191
12:12.920 --> 12:16.966
Well, I didn't mean to listen in or anything... [inhales sharply]

192
12:17.050 --> 12:19.344
...but I happened to overhear a little.

193
12:21.512 --> 12:23.014
[sighs loudly]

194
12:23.097 --> 12:26.768
By the way, what's up with you and Youjin?

195
12:27.602 --> 12:28.728
[Sejin] Hmm?

196
12:28.811 --> 12:31.064
Might as well try to get along with your cohort.

197
12:32.357 --> 12:33.858
[Sejin breathing heavily]

198
12:33.941 --> 12:36.652
I mean, you'll be working together for at least two years,

199
12:36.736 --> 12:38.446
and maybe for the rest of your life.

200
12:38.529 --> 12:40.531
So why not just get along?

201
12:43.701 --> 12:46.454
She keeps acting selfish and getting on my nerves.

202
12:47.705 --> 12:51.334
Hey, what do you mean, she's selfish and getting on your nerves? When?

203
12:53.753 --> 12:55.838
Maybe you don't like certain things about her,

204
12:55.922 --> 12:59.092
but why don't you try to give a little too, you know?

205
13:00.301 --> 13:02.136
But she doesn't give an inch either.

206
13:02.970 --> 13:05.014
So why should I? Because she's a woman?

207
13:05.098 --> 13:08.893
No, not because she's a woman, but as her colleague and her friend.

208
13:09.602 --> 13:12.563
Sometimes, you can just give in and let her have her way.

209
13:13.856 --> 13:14.857
Huh?

210
13:16.484 --> 13:17.985
Forget it. Bye.

211
13:18.611 --> 13:19.612
Hey.

212
13:23.157 --> 13:25.785
If you're having dinner soon, do you want to eat together?

213
13:25.868 --> 13:27.120
I can order us something.

214
13:28.579 --> 13:30.748
No, I've got plans.

215
13:31.249 --> 13:33.918
I'll take you out for something good next time. Go.

216
14:02.071 --> 14:03.823
-[car door opens] -[♪ mysterious music plays]

217
14:14.542 --> 14:16.544
[♪ mysterious music turns intriguing]

218
14:40.776 --> 14:42.778
[♪ music stops]

219
14:43.654 --> 14:46.240
-[woman] Let me do it for you. -[Minjae] No, I can do it quickly.

220
14:47.909 --> 14:50.578
[woman] I should've booked a table in the hall, not a private room.

221
14:50.661 --> 14:52.496
[Minjae] No, the private room's good. It's quiet.

222
14:54.415 --> 14:56.334
[woman] I didn't know you wore sneakers like those.

223
14:56.834 --> 14:58.794
[Minjae] Yeah, why not? They're cute.

224
15:00.254 --> 15:04.091
[woman] Yeah. I guess you're still young enough to pull these off. [chuckles]

225
15:12.516 --> 15:14.894
Try the seaweed soup with sea urchin.

226
15:14.977 --> 15:16.520
I ordered it in advance.

227
15:16.604 --> 15:17.605
[Minjae] Okay.

228
15:21.776 --> 15:22.985
Mmm...

229
15:23.069 --> 15:24.070
It's nice.

230
15:24.153 --> 15:28.032
You didn't even get to have seaweed soup on your birthday, did you?

231
15:28.115 --> 15:31.160
Actually, I did. I had seaweed soup and cake too.

232
15:32.745 --> 15:34.538
I did the whole birthday thing.

233
15:34.622 --> 15:36.415
And? What else did you do?

234
15:37.458 --> 15:39.877
[Minjae] And I went to the amusement park.

235
15:40.378 --> 15:42.546
I had a good time with friends.

236
15:44.090 --> 15:45.424
[woman] Okay, that's good.

237
15:45.508 --> 15:48.469
I wasn't able to do anything for your birthday.

238
15:49.011 --> 15:51.013
[Minjae] Come on, you're doing this for me now.

239
15:52.139 --> 15:55.518
Ah, right, you said Juwon's in second grade now?

240
15:55.601 --> 15:57.812
Yeah, he's in second grade now.

241
15:57.895 --> 16:00.773
He'll be a senior next year, but he just won't study. [chuckles]

242
16:00.856 --> 16:04.735
[chuckles] Just leave him alone. He'll figure it out on his own.

243
16:05.361 --> 16:07.321
I was dead last in my class at his age, too.

244
16:08.072 --> 16:10.950
You just didn't study because you were busy training.

245
16:12.451 --> 16:14.912
You're incredibly smart.

246
16:17.206 --> 16:18.874
He's not like you.

247
16:18.958 --> 16:22.211
I think he takes after his dad. He's not that smart. [chuckles]

248
16:22.295 --> 16:23.296
Ah...

249
16:24.380 --> 16:28.175
How's your husband doing? Busy as always?

250
16:28.259 --> 16:33.472
Mmm... Yeah. Well, he wanted to join us today, but he just couldn't make the time.

251
16:34.473 --> 16:38.185
It's okay, there's always next time. I know he's busy.

252
16:39.729 --> 16:40.730
Mmm...

253
16:41.439 --> 16:42.523
And this...

254
16:45.651 --> 16:47.153
Here. It's for your birthday.

255
16:48.612 --> 16:52.575
Just the dinner would've been enough. You didn't have to buy anything.

256
16:53.075 --> 16:55.453
It's a watch. Open it.

257
16:55.536 --> 16:56.537
A watch?

258
17:01.042 --> 17:02.168
It's an expensive one.

259
17:03.544 --> 17:04.545
[woman] Do you like it?

260
17:06.380 --> 17:08.799
No, Mom, it's too expensive.

261
17:11.177 --> 17:12.636
Do you want me to put it on you?

262
17:13.220 --> 17:14.221
It's okay.

263
17:20.186 --> 17:21.854
Your clothes don't have to be fancy,

264
17:21.937 --> 17:24.565
but you should always have on a nice watch and nice shoes.

265
17:29.612 --> 17:33.574
By the way, did your girlfriend buy you those sneakers?

266
17:34.867 --> 17:36.619
No, I said I bought them.

267
17:36.702 --> 17:39.789
It's okay, you can tell me. Are you being shy?

268
17:39.872 --> 17:42.541
No, I'm not being shy. I really bought them myself.

269
17:44.835 --> 17:47.338
Fine. You don't need to tell me if you don't want to.

270
17:48.297 --> 17:49.965
I'm being so nosy, aren't I?

271
17:55.638 --> 17:59.558
[sighs] Everyone says you're nice and mature,

272
18:01.769 --> 18:03.896
but you're actually narrow-minded and stubborn.

273
18:06.649 --> 18:08.067
That happened ages ago.

274
18:08.734 --> 18:10.903
Now, you're a grown man well into your thirties,

275
18:10.986 --> 18:12.446
and you're still so immature.

276
18:13.614 --> 18:15.533
I know you're still holding it against me.

277
18:21.038 --> 18:22.748
What was I supposed to do,

278
18:23.332 --> 18:25.418
just let you die when surgery could save you?

279
18:31.841 --> 18:35.469
You still should've asked me.

280
18:36.679 --> 18:39.724
What difference would it have made if I'd asked you?

281
18:40.933 --> 18:42.768
There was no other choice.

282
18:43.352 --> 18:44.979
There were other options,

283
18:46.188 --> 18:48.149
and I should've been the one to decide.

284
18:52.945 --> 18:54.280
[sighs] Fine.

285
18:54.363 --> 18:58.200
I'm sick of having the same conversation.

286
18:59.952 --> 19:00.953
[huffs]

287
19:03.164 --> 19:04.749
No matter how old you get,

288
19:05.458 --> 19:07.376
you'll never understand how a parent feels.

289
19:07.960 --> 19:10.421
How... [chuckling] How a parent feels?

290
19:13.466 --> 19:15.092
Sorry, that was just too funny.

291
19:16.093 --> 19:17.094
Sorry.

292
19:18.512 --> 19:19.722
[sighs]

293
19:22.099 --> 19:23.934
So why did you reach out to me then?

294
19:26.103 --> 19:27.313
Because I was young.

295
19:28.481 --> 19:30.149
I was told I was dying of cancer,

296
19:31.400 --> 19:33.903
so I wanted to see my birth mother at least once.

297
19:35.404 --> 19:36.655
That's why I reached out.

298
19:37.156 --> 19:39.200
[♪ emotional music playing]

299
19:39.283 --> 19:43.037
But still, you should've just said hello and left.

300
19:44.038 --> 19:45.539
Why did you overstep?

301
19:51.003 --> 19:54.799
Today, I really braced myself before coming here.

302
19:56.091 --> 19:57.802
But I just can never win with you.

303
20:00.387 --> 20:01.388
[sighs ruefully]

304
20:30.918 --> 20:33.170
[door lock beeping]

305
20:34.463 --> 20:35.548
[door lock chimes]

306
20:50.938 --> 20:52.940
[♪ music continues playing]

307
21:24.346 --> 21:25.347
[grunting]

308
21:36.525 --> 21:37.610
[angrily] For God's sake!

309
21:37.693 --> 21:39.486
What the hell is wrong with you?

310
21:39.570 --> 21:41.739
[yelling] Seriously, what the hell is wrong with you?

311
21:41.822 --> 21:43.407
[muttering] What a freaking psycho.

312
21:43.490 --> 21:44.950
You piece of shit.

313
21:46.535 --> 21:47.745
[yells] God damn it!

314
21:47.828 --> 21:51.665
[panting]

315
21:53.125 --> 21:55.127
[breathing heavily]

316
22:03.594 --> 22:05.596
[♪ music stops]

317
22:09.391 --> 22:10.392
[Chansoo] Was she pretty?

318
22:10.476 --> 22:11.477
Was she?

319
22:12.519 --> 22:14.313
I only saw her back. Not her face.

320
22:14.396 --> 22:16.357
Come on, you should've seen her face.

321
22:16.899 --> 22:21.820
I didn't see her face, but from behind, she had curly hair

322
22:21.904 --> 22:25.115
and this really polished, expensive-looking vibe.

323
22:25.199 --> 22:26.575
Definitely not a Hongdae vibe.

324
22:27.952 --> 22:30.120
More like Gangnam, maybe?

325
22:30.204 --> 22:31.914
In other words, a pretty vibe?

326
22:31.997 --> 22:33.165
-[Sejin] Yes. -Nice.

327
22:34.416 --> 22:39.213
But she had this mature vibe.

328
22:40.089 --> 22:43.175
She had this mature, older sister vibe. That's the impression I got.

329
22:43.759 --> 22:45.761
Wait, could they be related then?

330
22:46.428 --> 22:48.722
Maybe she's his cousin or something.

331
22:49.431 --> 22:51.183
She's definitely not his cousin.

332
22:51.266 --> 22:54.019
She was touching his face like this.

333
22:56.355 --> 22:57.815
Let me call her.

334
22:57.898 --> 23:00.150
-[Sejin] Her? Who? -Chacha.

335
23:02.820 --> 23:05.322
[line connects, rings]

336
23:05.406 --> 23:07.658
[hesitating] Hello, Seohyun. You picked up fast.

337
23:07.741 --> 23:11.245
Are you busy? Okay, you're busy, but let me ask you something real quick.

338
23:11.328 --> 23:16.250
Apparently, someone saw Minjae secretly meeting up with some woman. Mmm...

339
23:16.333 --> 23:20.254
She was squeezing his cheeks like this.

340
23:20.337 --> 23:23.424
Then they got into a white Mercedes and drove off together.

341
23:23.507 --> 23:24.508
Yes.

342
23:24.591 --> 23:26.927
Yeah, right. Yeah.

343
23:28.262 --> 23:29.471
What?

344
23:29.555 --> 23:30.556
Yeah.

345
23:30.639 --> 23:32.599
What does she say? Does she know her?

346
23:33.267 --> 23:34.852
[Taeho] No, wait.

347
23:34.935 --> 23:36.270
[whispering] She says it's not like

348
23:36.353 --> 23:38.272
there's only one white Mercedes in the world.

349
23:38.355 --> 23:40.524
She's right. Hey, did you see the license plate?

350
23:40.607 --> 23:43.277
-No, I didn't. -[mumbles] You should've seen that.

351
23:43.360 --> 23:44.862
[in normal voice] Hello? Seohyun, yes.

352
23:44.945 --> 23:47.114
No, we don't know the license plate number.

353
23:48.741 --> 23:51.869
No, Seohyun, I don't think that's necessary. Yeah.

354
23:52.995 --> 23:54.788
No. Wait, no.

355
23:54.872 --> 23:57.416
-No, that's... No. What the hell? -[line disconnects]

356
23:58.042 --> 24:00.002
What is it? Why?

357
24:00.085 --> 24:02.379
Damn it. She's coming to school again.

358
24:02.463 --> 24:03.464
Why?

359
24:03.547 --> 24:06.383
-From now on, don't call Seohyun. -Yeah.

360
24:06.467 --> 24:08.844
-We can handle things on our own. -Okay.

361
24:09.928 --> 24:12.139
Seriously, what is wrong with you? [tuts]

362
24:13.974 --> 24:14.975
[♪ comical music playing]

363
24:15.059 --> 24:16.977
Handle? Handle what?

364
24:17.603 --> 24:18.771
[Chansoo] Huh?

365
24:18.854 --> 24:20.564
What did you guys do this time?

366
24:20.647 --> 24:21.648
[Taeho] Minjae.

367
24:21.732 --> 24:22.733
[Minjae] Yeah?

368
24:23.233 --> 24:25.069
[Taeho] Even Seohyun said she didn't know.

369
24:25.152 --> 24:26.153
Who was she?

370
24:27.362 --> 24:29.823
Hey, you even called Seohyun?

371
24:29.907 --> 24:34.620
Apparently, she was smiling and squishing your face like this.

372
24:34.703 --> 24:36.538
And you had a big smile on your face.

373
24:36.622 --> 24:39.750
I had a big smile? Me?

374
24:40.250 --> 24:41.543
-Well... -[Minjae] When?

375
24:41.627 --> 24:43.962
That's what I heard. [chuckles]

376
24:44.046 --> 24:45.756
There's a witness, you know.

377
24:45.839 --> 24:48.175
Who's that crazy witness? Tell me. Huh?

378
24:49.134 --> 24:52.638
She's not your cousin, is she?

379
24:52.721 --> 24:56.058
No, she's not a relative or anyone from his family.

380
24:56.141 --> 24:57.976
Why would his cousin touch his face?

381
24:58.560 --> 25:00.395
Even siblings don't do that.

382
25:05.651 --> 25:08.362
Right. She's not my cousin.

383
25:10.864 --> 25:11.865
[sighs]

384
25:13.450 --> 25:15.077
She's someone I used to like.

385
25:16.870 --> 25:18.580
I still like her.

386
25:19.915 --> 25:23.127
So are you two dating or something?

387
25:23.210 --> 25:25.212
No, we're not dating.

388
25:25.295 --> 25:26.421
She's married.

389
25:26.505 --> 25:28.006
She has a son too.

390
25:28.841 --> 25:29.842
Uh...

391
25:30.509 --> 25:33.595
Wait, you met up with a married woman? Why?

392
25:34.596 --> 25:37.975
Well, she said she wanted to see me for my birthday, so I met up with her.

393
25:38.559 --> 25:41.478
She even got me an expensive watch for my birthday.

394
25:41.562 --> 25:42.813
I'll wear it next time.

395
25:44.815 --> 25:46.525
Anyone else have any questions?

396
25:46.608 --> 25:48.610
Minjae, does that mean you've been...

397
25:48.694 --> 25:49.987
[Youjin] But she's married.

398
25:50.571 --> 25:53.782
Meeting up because she missed you and exchanging gifts? That's just weird.

399
25:53.866 --> 25:55.576
We're kind of weird.

400
25:56.160 --> 25:58.996
"We..." [scoffs] "We"?

401
25:59.079 --> 26:00.539
Yes, we. She and I.

402
26:01.456 --> 26:02.708
[Youjin chuckles awkwardly]

403
26:04.877 --> 26:08.672
If you're still so hung up on each other, why don't you get back together?

404
26:08.755 --> 26:09.882
She can get divorced.

405
26:09.965 --> 26:12.342
Come on, realistically, divorce would be a bit much.

406
26:12.843 --> 26:14.052
[Youjin] No, it's not.

407
26:14.136 --> 26:16.221
They say love transcends borders and age.

408
26:17.181 --> 26:19.057
She should get divorced first, okay?

409
26:19.141 --> 26:21.768
Don't sneak around, deceiving and betraying people.

410
26:21.852 --> 26:23.353
Wait, what are you talking about?

411
26:23.437 --> 26:26.023
When did I ever deceive or betray anyone?

412
26:28.066 --> 26:29.484
You're deceiving her husband.

413
26:29.568 --> 26:30.569
[Minjae] No.

414
26:31.278 --> 26:34.072
He knows everything. Her husband and I know each other.

415
26:35.532 --> 26:36.909
-[Youjin] Her husband knows? -[Minjae] Yes.

416
26:38.327 --> 26:40.120
[scoffs] You people are so weird.

417
26:40.204 --> 26:41.580
I told you we're weird.

418
26:44.082 --> 26:45.584
Anything else you want to know?

419
26:45.667 --> 26:47.211
-Chansoo, how about you? -Minjae.

420
26:47.294 --> 26:48.503
[Youjin] So if she asks to see you again...

421
26:48.587 --> 26:49.588
[Minjae] Uh, yes?

422
26:50.714 --> 26:51.965
...are you going to?

423
26:54.176 --> 26:56.678
Yeah, if she wants to see me, I'll see her.

424
27:10.400 --> 27:11.652
Thank you.

425
27:11.735 --> 27:12.736
[Chansoo] Are you okay?

426
27:13.528 --> 27:14.529
[Youjin] Yes.

427
27:18.825 --> 27:21.328
[Sejin whispering] It's nothing. It's just that time of the month.

428
27:21.411 --> 27:23.163
You know, girl stuff.

429
27:24.915 --> 27:25.916
What?

430
27:25.999 --> 27:27.960
[Youjin] I just don't understand.

431
27:29.211 --> 27:30.462
I'm talking about Minjae.

432
27:31.505 --> 27:33.298
What on earth goes on in men's heads...

433
27:37.344 --> 27:38.845
No, never mind.

434
27:38.929 --> 27:42.140
[Chansoo] Taeho, is Seohyun... I mean, did you tell her not to come?

435
27:42.224 --> 27:44.184
She's not coming. [chuckles] Don't worry.

436
27:44.726 --> 27:47.854
Damn, we almost had that crazy girl show up again. [chuckles]

437
27:47.938 --> 27:49.731
Hey, you think this is funny?

438
27:51.108 --> 27:52.109
Right. [sighs]

439
27:52.609 --> 27:54.945
Shouldn't we do something about it?

440
27:56.196 --> 27:59.366
I mean, no matter how much he likes her, she's married.

441
28:00.534 --> 28:02.995
It's just morally and ethically wrong.

442
28:03.078 --> 28:04.204
Just leave him be.

443
28:04.746 --> 28:06.915
They like each other. It's none of our business.

444
28:07.874 --> 28:10.585
Just leave him be. Let him live, die, or stay like garbage.

445
28:10.669 --> 28:12.004
Let him do whatever he wants.

446
28:12.587 --> 28:16.967
But still, we can't just sit back and watch.

447
28:17.050 --> 28:19.886
Yeah. Then the crazy girl will show up again.

448
28:19.970 --> 28:20.971
[Taeho sighs]

449
28:21.054 --> 28:23.181
So, do you have any idea what we should do?

450
28:23.265 --> 28:25.642
[inhales sharply] Let's see.

451
28:26.268 --> 28:28.186
You said she was really pretty, right?

452
28:29.187 --> 28:32.274
[inhales sharply] In that case... [sighs]

453
28:35.152 --> 28:37.779
We can find a prettier woman and set him up with her.

454
28:38.739 --> 28:40.407
-[Hangyeol and Chansoo] Oh! -[Taeho] Yeah.

455
28:40.907 --> 28:42.075
Right, Youjin.

456
28:42.159 --> 28:46.371
Do you have any pretty friends we could set him up with?

457
28:47.039 --> 28:48.040
No.

458
28:48.623 --> 28:51.460
He's petty and weird. Whoever we set him up with would hate us.

459
28:51.543 --> 28:52.544
[Taeho mumbles] True.

460
28:55.839 --> 28:57.758
We'd have to mention his disability, too.

461
28:57.841 --> 29:00.260
It wouldn't be easy to set him up with normal people.

462
29:01.762 --> 29:02.763
[Youjin] Hey, you.

463
29:03.263 --> 29:04.264
"Hey, you?"

464
29:04.848 --> 29:07.100
We're the same age, so I'll drop the formalities.

465
29:07.184 --> 29:08.769
What exactly did you mean by that?

466
29:08.852 --> 29:10.145
What?

467
29:10.228 --> 29:12.731
You said there are normal people, and Minjae is disabled.

468
29:12.814 --> 29:15.400
Are you saying he's abnormal or somehow less of a person?

469
29:16.777 --> 29:17.778
No.

470
29:17.861 --> 29:20.363
What do you mean, no? That's exactly what you said.

471
29:20.447 --> 29:23.241
Why are you talking so disrespectfully about your senior?

472
29:23.325 --> 29:26.286
You also just called him petty and weird

473
29:26.369 --> 29:28.580
and said anyone we set him up with would hate us.

474
29:29.372 --> 29:32.125
[scoffs] What I said is different from what you said.

475
29:32.209 --> 29:34.086
Different? Different how?

476
29:38.256 --> 29:40.967
What? A blind date, all of a sudden?

477
29:41.051 --> 29:44.012
[Youjin] Yeah. You saw him the other day too.

478
29:44.096 --> 29:45.680
Park Minjae, our lab lead.

479
29:47.349 --> 29:51.394
He's really cool, good-looking, and kind. [chuckles awkwardly]

480
29:51.478 --> 29:53.480
And he's smart too.

481
29:53.563 --> 29:56.566
That senior from your lab who works as a research assistant?

482
29:57.984 --> 29:59.736
Yeah, of course I remember him.

483
30:00.529 --> 30:02.447
But a blind date with him?

484
30:04.116 --> 30:05.117
Yeah.

485
30:06.535 --> 30:07.702
It's not that.

486
30:08.537 --> 30:11.373
I'm just too busy right now to think about anything else.

487
30:11.873 --> 30:14.084
[Youjin] Oh... Yeah, of course.

488
30:15.377 --> 30:17.170
Well, if you're busy, that's okay.

489
30:17.254 --> 30:18.296
All right.

490
30:18.922 --> 30:19.923
Bye.

491
30:22.259 --> 30:24.344
[sighs] She's too busy.

492
30:37.899 --> 30:41.111
[Subin] Professor, here's the research I did on the papers you mentioned.

493
30:41.194 --> 30:42.779
Okay. Thank you.

494
30:44.114 --> 30:47.367
Was the call you just got about someone setting you up on a blind date?

495
30:48.034 --> 30:49.953
[Subin chuckling] Uh, yes.

496
30:50.787 --> 30:53.582
Work is important, but you need to put yourself out there

497
30:53.665 --> 30:56.168
and date while you're young and pretty.

498
30:57.169 --> 30:59.171
Look at me. Time flies.

499
30:59.254 --> 31:02.257
Mmm... You're still young and pretty.

500
31:02.340 --> 31:04.217
[Miran scoffs] Are you teasing me right now?

501
31:04.801 --> 31:05.802
Enough already.

502
31:07.888 --> 31:09.556
That was Youjin on the phone, right?

503
31:10.473 --> 31:11.474
[Subin] Yes.

504
31:11.975 --> 31:15.228
Was she trying to set you up with that disabled guy?

505
31:15.312 --> 31:16.313
Uh...

506
31:17.731 --> 31:20.108
If he's so great, why doesn't she date him herself?

507
31:20.192 --> 31:22.402
You don't set a friend up with someone like that.

508
31:23.111 --> 31:26.740
I don't think that's... He seemed like a nice person, though.

509
31:27.240 --> 31:30.452
Youjin must think so too. That's why she tried to set me up with...

510
31:31.786 --> 31:34.956
Did she really not know he was disabled before you mentioned it?

511
31:36.041 --> 31:38.043
Yeah, it looked like she had no idea.

512
31:38.126 --> 31:39.753
She seemed really surprised.

513
31:39.836 --> 31:41.838
You didn't say you heard it from me, did you?

514
31:42.464 --> 31:44.257
[Subin] I didn't say that.

515
31:45.508 --> 31:49.888
Well, once something catches my interest, I can't help wanting to know more.

516
31:50.972 --> 31:54.392
[sighs] My memory is just too good for my own good.

517
31:55.352 --> 31:57.103
It's exhausting, but what can I do?

518
31:57.187 --> 32:00.482
I never forget and always return even the smallest favor.

519
32:03.485 --> 32:04.486
You can go now.

520
32:05.028 --> 32:06.029
Okay.

521
32:12.911 --> 32:15.747
I mean, it never made sense from the start.

522
32:16.456 --> 32:20.126
He's already into someone, and we set him up with another woman?

523
32:20.210 --> 32:21.461
That's just ridiculous.

524
32:21.544 --> 32:23.630
[Taeho] Well, Youjin, you're saying that

525
32:23.713 --> 32:26.841
because you're still young and don't understand men yet.

526
32:26.925 --> 32:28.218
Men aren't like that.

527
32:28.885 --> 32:31.346
We believe we can find love anytime,

528
32:31.429 --> 32:33.265
so we always keep our options open.

529
32:34.015 --> 32:36.184
Yeah, there's even a song

530
32:36.268 --> 32:38.478
called "A Love Is Forgotten by Another Love."

531
32:39.062 --> 32:40.689
[singing] ♪ A love ♪

532
32:42.065 --> 32:45.902
[Sejin and Taeho in unison] ♪ Is forgotten by another love ♪

533
32:47.529 --> 32:49.531
-Such a great song. -[Taeho] It sure is.

534
32:50.031 --> 32:55.537
But Minjae isn't the type of guy who jumps from one woman to another, is he?

535
32:56.162 --> 33:00.292
Youjin, all men are basically the same.

536
33:00.875 --> 33:02.168
We're all the same.

537
33:03.670 --> 33:06.965
But I understand why Youjin is concerned.

538
33:07.841 --> 33:10.093
No, I'm not. I'm not concerned.

539
33:11.011 --> 33:14.222
Minjae doesn't do blind dates, so he might say no.

540
33:15.598 --> 33:17.684
[Youjin] Yeah, exactly. That's what I'm talking about.

541
33:18.601 --> 33:19.853
[Hangyeol] He might.

542
33:20.353 --> 33:22.981
Shy people can find blind dates uncomfortable.

543
33:23.064 --> 33:26.776
The bottom line is, it doesn't have to be a blind date.

544
33:26.860 --> 33:28.778
But it has to feel like fate.

545
33:28.862 --> 33:31.865
Yeah. Like getting hit by a bike,

546
33:31.948 --> 33:35.493
dropping a handkerchief, or accidentally swapping phones.

547
33:35.577 --> 33:37.662
You know, stuff we see in movies all the time.

548
33:37.746 --> 33:40.957
We can work out the details later.

549
33:41.041 --> 33:42.042
The problem is...

550
33:42.792 --> 33:44.878
we haven't found a woman for him yet.

551
33:45.795 --> 33:46.921
[all sigh]

552
33:49.090 --> 33:53.636
Hey, Lim Youjin. Try calling someone else. Don't you have any other friends?

553
33:53.720 --> 33:55.347
-I don't. -[cellphone vibrates]

554
33:55.430 --> 33:57.724
Guys, don't worry. Yeah, we got the woman.

555
33:57.807 --> 33:58.808
[Chansoo] What?

556
33:58.892 --> 34:00.810
Seohyun has someone from work.

557
34:00.894 --> 34:02.103
What?

558
34:02.187 --> 34:04.606
[Taeho] Wow, she's really pretty. [chuckles]

559
34:04.689 --> 34:06.691
-Guys, have a look. -[Hangyeol] Sorry, Youjin.

560
34:07.650 --> 34:09.944
[men exclaiming]

561
34:10.445 --> 34:11.446
[door opens]

562
34:12.489 --> 34:14.282
[men continues exclaiming]

563
34:16.701 --> 34:18.578
[♪ slow quirky music playing]

564
34:18.661 --> 34:20.663
-[Hangyeol] I think she looks nice. -[men exclaiming]

565
34:36.262 --> 34:37.263
[cellphone vibrates]

566
34:40.266 --> 34:41.851
LIM YOUJIN

567
34:41.935 --> 34:43.061
[Youjin] What are you up to?

568
34:48.108 --> 34:49.526
[Minjae] I'm on my way somewhere.

569
34:53.446 --> 34:54.614
[Youjin] To the movies?

570
34:56.282 --> 34:57.283
With Seohyun?

571
35:02.747 --> 35:03.915
[Minjae] How did you know?

572
35:05.208 --> 35:07.043
[Youjin] What movie are you going to watch?

573
35:08.753 --> 35:09.879
[Minjae] Not going to tell you.

574
35:11.923 --> 35:12.924
[sighs]

575
35:16.344 --> 35:18.012
[Youjin] Can I join you?

576
35:23.226 --> 35:25.395
[Minjae] Yeah, no, get lost.

577
35:34.946 --> 35:35.947
[sighs]

578
36:04.225 --> 36:06.227
[cellphone vibrating]

579
36:15.320 --> 36:16.321
Hello?

580
36:18.990 --> 36:19.991
Hello?

581
36:21.868 --> 36:22.869
Hel--

582
36:22.952 --> 36:24.954
[♪ music stops]

583
36:28.374 --> 36:30.376
[♪ gentle music playing on stereo]

584
36:34.589 --> 36:35.965
[Youjin] I won't keep you long.

585
36:39.010 --> 36:41.638
Okay. What is it you wanted to say?

586
36:51.314 --> 36:53.024
I know you're mad at me.

587
36:53.900 --> 36:54.901
[sighs wearily]

588
36:55.652 --> 36:57.237
We're talking about this again?

589
36:58.279 --> 37:01.199
Look, I apologized. What more do you want me to do?

590
37:01.282 --> 37:02.534
That's not what happened.

591
37:03.743 --> 37:07.413
I apologized to you, but you got mad and were being sarcastic.

592
37:11.209 --> 37:12.794
I know what I did wasn't right.

593
37:14.504 --> 37:16.381
So you could've just yelled at me,

594
37:17.423 --> 37:20.343
or told me to keep apologizing until you felt better.

595
37:22.679 --> 37:24.514
Why get all sarcastic and mean?

596
37:25.515 --> 37:26.683
Okay, sorry.

597
37:27.433 --> 37:29.435
I didn't mean to be sarcastic, though.

598
37:31.229 --> 37:33.898
I don't know. I think that's just how I am. I'm sorry.

599
37:34.899 --> 37:35.942
Again...

600
37:36.025 --> 37:37.151
Shall we head out now?

601
37:37.944 --> 37:38.945
[Youjin] But...

602
37:41.531 --> 37:43.408
No matter how petty and mean you get,

603
37:44.868 --> 37:46.494
I just can't seem to hate you.

604
37:49.664 --> 37:53.167
I get annoyed, I get angry, and I don't understand you,

605
37:55.253 --> 37:56.838
but I just can't seem to hate you.

606
37:58.882 --> 38:00.383
Actually, it's more than that.

607
38:03.761 --> 38:04.804
I just...

608
38:06.389 --> 38:07.682
keep wanting to see you.

609
38:12.353 --> 38:13.813
I want to see you,

610
38:15.189 --> 38:16.566
and I want to be with you.

611
38:19.694 --> 38:21.779
I don't want to lose you to someone else.

612
38:22.780 --> 38:25.491
I don't know how to put it, but...

613
38:32.332 --> 38:33.333
I...

614
38:34.918 --> 38:36.044
like you.

615
38:37.712 --> 38:39.422
I like you a lot.

616
39:02.987 --> 39:05.782
I know I'm the woman here, but I'm going to put my pride aside

617
39:07.408 --> 39:08.826
and make the first move.

618
39:11.746 --> 39:12.872
Park Minjae...

619
39:15.291 --> 39:16.417
I like you.

620
39:18.336 --> 39:20.171
I want you to be my boyfriend.

621
39:35.770 --> 39:36.771
[chuckles softly]

622
39:39.857 --> 39:41.150
Wow.

623
39:41.234 --> 39:42.235
[chuckles]

624
39:44.278 --> 39:45.655
You're really...

625
39:49.242 --> 39:51.911
Did you really not see it, or are you just pretending?

626
39:52.996 --> 39:53.997
[Youjin] What?

627
39:57.458 --> 40:00.461
I mean, I'm not trying to be sarcastic or mean here.

628
40:02.338 --> 40:03.548
You know what?

629
40:03.631 --> 40:07.135
I'm going to put my pride as a man aside and be honest with you.

630
40:09.178 --> 40:10.179
Imagine...

631
40:11.764 --> 40:13.141
how I felt...

632
40:15.101 --> 40:16.686
after you left like that.

633
40:19.188 --> 40:22.817
Of course, I know you were caught off guard and scared too.

634
40:23.776 --> 40:24.777
I...

635
40:24.861 --> 40:26.821
[Minjae] What about me? How do you think I felt?

636
40:27.488 --> 40:31.325
How do you think I felt after you just left like that?

637
40:34.203 --> 40:35.955
Can you imagine how I must've felt?

638
40:40.126 --> 40:41.586
My heart broke.

639
40:42.920 --> 40:44.255
I wanted to die.

640
40:49.469 --> 40:50.470
I'm...

641
40:52.096 --> 40:55.058
shy, I'm a coward,

642
40:56.768 --> 40:58.144
and I've been hurt before.

643
41:01.355 --> 41:03.274
I'm not the right person for you.

644
41:09.405 --> 41:10.740
I'm officially...

645
41:13.117 --> 41:14.619
turning you down.

646
41:18.122 --> 41:22.710
I hope this doesn't make things awkward between us in the lab.

647
41:26.506 --> 41:27.632
I'm going to head out.

648
41:37.725 --> 41:39.727
[♪ somber music playing]

649
43:08.399 --> 43:09.400
[Minjae mumbles] You scared me.

650
43:09.483 --> 43:11.485
[♪ music continues playing]

651
43:11.569 --> 43:13.571
[indistinct conversation]

652
44:46.247 --> 44:48.249
[♪ music stops]

653
44:49.750 --> 44:52.378
[groans] I've been washing it with soap,

654
44:52.461 --> 44:54.088
but the grease just won't come out.

655
44:54.714 --> 44:57.133
So just put on the gloves like me.

656
44:57.216 --> 44:59.051
I mean, I don't even like dumplings.

657
44:59.135 --> 45:01.429
And Lim Youjin is going to eat all of those anyway.

658
45:02.179 --> 45:04.015
Honestly, I hope she does.

659
45:04.640 --> 45:07.310
She's eating like a bird these days.

660
45:07.393 --> 45:10.146
I bet she's eating plenty of good food when she's out.

661
45:11.230 --> 45:13.399
Call Youjin and tell her I'm making dumplings,

662
45:13.482 --> 45:14.942
so she should come home early.

663
45:19.280 --> 45:21.991
[cellphone vibrating]

664
45:26.746 --> 45:27.913
Hello?

665
45:27.997 --> 45:30.249
[Youseong] Hey, Lim Youjin. Where are you now?

666
45:31.417 --> 45:34.503
I'm at school. Where else would I be? I said I was going to school.

667
45:35.004 --> 45:38.466
I'd bet my last penny you're out having fun, not at school.

668
45:40.968 --> 45:43.929
Hey, where are you? I'm making dumplings now.

669
45:46.474 --> 45:47.558
Yeah.

670
45:48.726 --> 45:49.769
Okay.

671
45:49.852 --> 45:51.937
All right. Don't be late.

672
45:52.021 --> 45:53.022
Okay.

673
45:53.105 --> 45:54.565
-You can hang up now. -Hey, you--

674
45:54.648 --> 45:55.649
[line disconnects]

675
45:55.733 --> 45:57.068
When is she going to be home?

676
45:57.151 --> 45:58.986
She's going to study before coming home.

677
45:59.070 --> 46:01.697
But she'll be back for dinner and have the dumplings.

678
46:02.531 --> 46:05.326
She's not at school right now. She's out somewhere with a man.

679
46:06.994 --> 46:09.622
Fine. Good luck betting what little money you have on it.

680
46:09.705 --> 46:11.248
I have proof.

681
46:11.832 --> 46:15.086
-What proof? -Proof that Lim Youjin is seeing a guy.

682
46:16.837 --> 46:18.964
Did you read Youjin's diary again?

683
46:19.048 --> 46:21.050
Come on, I told you to stop doing that.

684
46:21.634 --> 46:24.011
I only did that until she was in high school.

685
46:24.095 --> 46:26.430
That brat stopped keeping a diary in college.

686
46:26.514 --> 46:27.598
[groans softly]

687
46:28.516 --> 46:30.643
So if it's not her diary, what's the proof?

688
46:31.143 --> 46:33.729
You want to know? Then give me 100,000 won.

689
46:36.190 --> 46:38.442
What? 100,000 won isn't much.

690
46:38.526 --> 46:40.319
You keep that proof to yourself.

691
46:41.278 --> 46:44.198
Or you and Youjin will be at each other's throats again.

692
46:44.698 --> 46:47.368
And Mom will kick your ass again.

693
46:47.451 --> 46:48.452
Fine.

694
46:49.412 --> 46:52.248
If you don't want to know, forget it. It's no loss to me.

695
46:54.500 --> 46:56.210
Do you really have proof?

696
46:56.293 --> 46:58.963
Yes, I have solid evidence.

697
47:01.006 --> 47:03.717
All right. I'll give you 100,000 won. Bring it here.

698
47:03.801 --> 47:07.304
Really? Really? You promise? 100,000 won.

699
47:07.388 --> 47:08.556
You're so dead now.

700
47:10.891 --> 47:13.185
[Miyoung] Hey, don't go through Youjin's stuff.

701
47:16.439 --> 47:19.775
[Youseong] Where did it go? It was right here.

702
47:21.610 --> 47:22.611
[Miyoung] Hey.

703
47:23.696 --> 47:24.697
[Youseong] Where is it?

704
47:26.115 --> 47:28.409
Hey, stop going through her stuff.

705
47:29.452 --> 47:30.870
Don't give him the money, okay?

706
47:31.662 --> 47:33.414
[chuckling] What? I don't even have 10 won.

707
47:34.373 --> 47:35.458
[Youseong] Where did it go?

708
47:35.541 --> 47:37.877
[Miyoung] I told you to stop snooping around in Youjin's room.

709
47:37.960 --> 47:39.920
But it was definitely there.

710
47:40.004 --> 47:41.672
Please. There's no proof.

711
47:42.756 --> 47:46.302
I knew this would happen, so I made sure to gather more evidence.

712
47:46.385 --> 47:47.470
Just wait.

713
47:48.471 --> 47:50.806
Look. You still don't believe me?

714
47:50.890 --> 47:52.308
You still don't?

715
47:52.391 --> 47:53.392
[Miyoung] Oh my.

716
47:55.394 --> 47:56.770
Oh my gosh. Matching rings?

717
47:57.480 --> 47:59.899
I'm sure she's with her boyfriend right now.

718
48:02.526 --> 48:03.527
[cellphone thuds]

719
48:16.957 --> 48:19.502
OUT OF OFFICE

720
48:41.941 --> 48:43.734
[pants, groans]

721
48:46.445 --> 48:48.447
[♪ tense music playing]

722
48:55.663 --> 48:56.664
[grunts]

723
48:59.333 --> 49:00.793
[Jihoon] Are you feeling unwell?

724
49:00.876 --> 49:04.088
[Youjin weakly] No. I took some medicine, so I should be fine soon.

725
49:05.172 --> 49:06.840
Thank you. You can go.

726
49:07.883 --> 49:09.802
[Jihoon] Hold on to me and try to stand up.

727
49:10.761 --> 49:12.429
-[Youjin exclaims in pain] -[Jihoon] Oh!

728
49:12.513 --> 49:13.973
-[Youjin moaning in pain] -[Jihoon] I think you should see a doctor.

729
49:14.056 --> 49:16.058
[♪ music continues playing]

730
49:27.653 --> 49:30.072
We're almost at the hospital, so hang in there.

731
49:30.864 --> 49:32.533
[Youjin groans softly] I'm okay.

732
49:33.242 --> 49:36.620
[groaning in pain] You can just drop me off at the bus stop.

733
49:37.496 --> 49:39.540
-[mumbles] No, you're not okay. -[Youjin groans]

734
49:40.874 --> 49:44.461
[weakly] Are you Professor Talking Hat?

735
49:44.545 --> 49:46.797
[Youjin breathing heavily]

736
49:46.880 --> 49:47.965
[chuckles softly]

737
49:49.091 --> 49:50.092
[moans in pain]

738
49:51.468 --> 49:53.387
Are you delirious from being sick?

739
49:53.470 --> 49:55.014
[chuckling] Yeah.

740
49:55.097 --> 49:57.391
I guess I am. [chuckles]

741
49:59.018 --> 50:00.352
[groaning]

742
50:05.691 --> 50:07.401
[mumbles] Mom. [breath trembling]

743
50:07.484 --> 50:08.652
[Jihoon] What? What did you say?

744
50:09.570 --> 50:11.864
[groans softly] Mom.

745
50:13.490 --> 50:14.908
Mom.

746
50:14.992 --> 50:16.994
[♪ music intensifies]

747
50:25.544 --> 50:27.963
[Youjin groaning in pain]

748
50:39.308 --> 50:40.309
[Youjin whimpers]

749
50:41.018 --> 50:42.978
[doctor] When you're ready. One, two, three.

750
50:43.479 --> 50:45.147
[Youjin groans, cries]

751
50:45.230 --> 50:47.232
[moaning in pain]

752
50:59.495 --> 51:02.081
INCORRECT PATTERN

753
51:02.790 --> 51:05.167
INCORRECT PATTERN

754
51:05.250 --> 51:07.378
[♪ music stops]

755
51:13.300 --> 51:14.385
[Jihoon] Hello.

756
51:14.468 --> 51:15.844
It is appendicitis.

757
51:15.928 --> 51:18.222
She needs emergency surgery immediately.

758
51:18.305 --> 51:19.306
Are you her family?

759
51:19.390 --> 51:22.142
No, I'm not her family. She's a student at my university.

760
51:22.226 --> 51:23.602
[doctor] You're her teacher.

761
51:24.561 --> 51:27.106
It's urgent, so please sign here first.

762
51:29.692 --> 51:30.859
-Sign here? -[doctor] Yes.

763
51:52.631 --> 51:54.383
[cellphone vibrating]

764
51:54.466 --> 51:57.970
INCOMING CALL MOM

765
51:58.846 --> 52:01.098
Hello. This is Lim Youjin's phone.

766
52:06.353 --> 52:08.355
[♪ soft music playing]

767
52:12.526 --> 52:14.069
We're looking for Lim Youjin...

768
52:14.695 --> 52:16.780
[staff] She went into surgery a little while ago.

769
52:16.864 --> 52:17.990
Right. Okay.

770
52:18.490 --> 52:19.950
Where's the operating room?

771
52:20.033 --> 52:21.952
-[staff] Just go one floor up. -[Yongseok] Okay.

772
52:22.619 --> 52:23.620
[Miyoung] Thank you.

773
52:36.884 --> 52:38.051
[Minjae sighs softly]

774
52:55.944 --> 52:56.945
[Youjin] Mmm...

775
53:03.494 --> 53:04.536
[Miyoung] Youjin.

776
53:06.455 --> 53:07.915
Youjin, are you okay?

777
53:07.998 --> 53:09.666
It's Mom.

778
53:09.750 --> 53:12.878
-[Youjin] Mom. -Yeah. Dad's here too.

779
53:12.961 --> 53:13.962
Yeah.

780
53:14.755 --> 53:15.798
[Miyoung] Yeah.

781
53:16.882 --> 53:19.092
-[weakly] Mom. [sobs] -[Miyoung] Yeah.

782
53:19.176 --> 53:20.260
Does it hurt?

783
53:21.220 --> 53:22.387
Does it hurt a lot?

784
53:23.263 --> 53:24.723
No, I'm okay.

785
53:26.725 --> 53:29.478
[mumbles] You did great. You did so well.

786
53:31.438 --> 53:32.439
[sighs]

787
53:43.826 --> 53:44.827
Excuse me.

788
53:45.619 --> 53:46.954
It's past 9 a.m.

789
53:49.748 --> 53:52.960
It's past 9 a.m., and Lim Youjin is not here again.

790
53:56.213 --> 53:58.674
She's late again. [sighs]

791
54:00.801 --> 54:02.553
Should I give her a call?

792
54:08.267 --> 54:09.518
Should I give her a call?

793
54:09.601 --> 54:11.728
Just leave her alone. She'll get here eventually.

794
54:11.812 --> 54:15.315
[cellphone vibrating]

795
54:17.317 --> 54:19.653
Hey, if you're late, just come. Why are you calling...

796
54:21.989 --> 54:23.532
Yes, hello, ma'am.

797
54:23.615 --> 54:28.078
[sighing] Uh... I should've called earlier.

798
54:28.161 --> 54:29.162
I'm so sorry.

799
54:29.246 --> 54:32.749
No, not at all. I didn't know it was you, ma'am.

800
54:33.584 --> 54:35.002
I'm so sorry.

801
54:35.085 --> 54:36.336
Yes.

802
54:36.420 --> 54:37.421
No.

803
54:38.463 --> 54:39.464
Yes.

804
54:41.216 --> 54:42.551
Youjin?

805
54:43.468 --> 54:45.095
Oh... She's doing great.

806
54:45.178 --> 54:47.723
She works hard, she's talented,

807
54:47.806 --> 54:50.642
and the professors all speak very highly of her.

808
54:50.726 --> 54:52.519
Is that her mom calling right now?

809
54:55.731 --> 54:56.732
Yes.

810
54:58.483 --> 54:59.484
Yes.

811
55:00.736 --> 55:02.988
Ah... I see.

812
55:04.072 --> 55:05.073
Yes.

813
55:06.366 --> 55:07.367
Okay.

814
55:08.660 --> 55:10.245
Yes, I understand.

815
55:11.288 --> 55:13.915
Please tell her she doesn't need to worry about the lab

816
55:13.999 --> 55:15.834
and to just focus on getting better.

817
55:15.917 --> 55:19.880
[chuckling] Yes, thank you so much for understanding.

818
55:20.505 --> 55:23.258
Okay, take care. Bye.

819
55:26.261 --> 55:27.971
-[line disconnects] -[sighs in relief, chuckles softly]

820
55:29.056 --> 55:33.185
Hey, your senior's so polite, and he has such a nice voice.

821
55:34.895 --> 55:35.896
No, he doesn't.

822
55:36.396 --> 55:37.481
[Miyoung chuckles]

823
55:38.482 --> 55:39.691
[light thud]

824
55:39.775 --> 55:40.859
[Sejin scoffs]

825
55:42.027 --> 55:44.488
She had her mom call? Is she in elementary school?

826
55:44.571 --> 55:45.864
That's not it.

827
55:45.947 --> 55:48.408
Youjin just had surgery for appendicitis.

828
55:49.368 --> 55:52.120
Uh... So, she'll need to take a few days off.

829
55:52.954 --> 55:55.332
Appendicitis? She had her appendix removed?

830
55:55.415 --> 55:56.541
[Minjae] Yes.

831
55:59.670 --> 56:03.882
Well, she says she's okay, and the surgery went well.

832
56:03.965 --> 56:05.133
So don't worry too much.

833
56:05.676 --> 56:08.178
-I'm glad to hear the surgery went well. -[Minjae] Yeah.

834
56:08.720 --> 56:10.889
[clears throat] Well...

835
56:11.848 --> 56:14.976
These days, getting your appendix out is hardly even surgery...

836
56:15.060 --> 56:18.271
Surgery is surgery. What do you mean, it's hardly even surgery?

837
56:19.606 --> 56:20.649
Should we visit her?

838
56:21.191 --> 56:23.443
Apparently, they don't want any visitors.

839
56:24.653 --> 56:26.363
Well, they said not to come, so...

840
56:26.446 --> 56:28.907
But still, shouldn't we go check on her?

841
56:28.990 --> 56:32.035
But we'd just be bothering her while she's recovering.

842
56:33.453 --> 56:35.414
No, there's no need to go. Don't worry.

843
56:40.252 --> 56:42.254
[♪ gentle music builds]

844
56:43.463 --> 56:45.465
[keyboard clacking]

845
56:49.469 --> 56:50.470
[mouse clicks]

846
57:01.565 --> 57:03.567
[♪ gentle music playing]

847
57:32.846 --> 57:35.015
[♪ music stops]

848
58:46.586 --> 58:48.213
[Youjin] Professor Talking Hat?

849
58:52.217 --> 58:54.010
Why do you keep calling me "Talking Hat"?

850
58:56.388 --> 59:00.100
So, things ended with the ring guy?

851
59:04.271 --> 59:06.273
So all that going back and forth was for nothing.

852
59:06.773 --> 59:08.650
I still don't get it.

853
59:10.235 --> 59:12.070
When did things start going wrong?

854
59:13.238 --> 59:14.865
It was all wrong from the start.

855
59:15.740 --> 59:18.243
Getting involved with a loser was your first mistake.

856
59:21.204 --> 59:24.332
Good-looking guys always come with a catch.

857
59:25.584 --> 59:26.626
Except me.

858
59:27.794 --> 59:29.254
[clicks tongue] Okay.

859
59:31.590 --> 59:34.092
There are plenty of guys out there. Just find a new one.

860
59:35.552 --> 59:36.553
Okay.

861
59:38.680 --> 59:42.851
[sighs heavily] But is there really no other way?

862
59:42.934 --> 59:44.185
Professor Talking Hat?

863
59:47.147 --> 59:49.274
I'm not saying I want to make it work with him.

864
59:50.442 --> 59:52.569
But we're going to keep seeing each other,

865
59:53.987 --> 59:55.363
so I want to clear the air.

866
59:56.239 --> 59:57.991
Still persistent after that rejection?

867
59:58.575 --> 59:59.826
I'm not being persistent.

868
01:00:01.286 --> 01:00:04.080
I just want to make him feel better and more at ease.

869
01:00:06.041 --> 01:00:07.334
But I don't know how.

870
01:00:09.586 --> 01:00:12.714
[tuts] Will it work itself out with time?

871
01:00:12.797 --> 01:00:14.966
Isn't there anything else I can do?

872
01:00:15.050 --> 01:00:17.469
[Jihoon] You're stuck because you're solving the wrong problem.

873
01:00:18.803 --> 01:00:19.804
Pardon?

874
01:00:20.430 --> 01:00:23.183
Whether he's angry or hurting, he must figure it out himself.

875
01:00:23.266 --> 01:00:25.477
That's Minjae's problem to solve, not yours.

876
01:00:27.771 --> 01:00:30.732
Find your own problem, then find the answer to that problem.

877
01:00:35.987 --> 01:00:36.988
[Youjin] Huh?

878
01:00:38.406 --> 01:00:39.658
But why did you run away?

879
01:00:40.659 --> 01:00:41.660
What?

880
01:00:45.121 --> 01:00:46.456
I don't know.

881
01:00:46.539 --> 01:00:48.124
[Jihoon] You're lying. I know you do.

882
01:00:49.084 --> 01:00:50.126
[Youjin sighs softly]

883
01:00:52.003 --> 01:00:53.129
You like him,

884
01:00:54.589 --> 01:00:56.466
but you didn't want to face his scar.

885
01:00:59.886 --> 01:01:04.224
Was the scar on his leg or in his heart?

886
01:01:05.892 --> 01:01:10.438
Was it in his past, present, or future?

887
01:01:13.650 --> 01:01:15.819
I'm not sure what you mean.

888
01:01:16.403 --> 01:01:19.114
Exactly. I feel like I'm talking to a monkey right now.

889
01:01:19.614 --> 01:01:20.615
[Youjin scoffs]

890
01:01:22.659 --> 01:01:24.911
-What are you looking at? -I'm just looking.

891
01:01:26.746 --> 01:01:28.790
[snickers] Fine. You're sick, so I'll let it slide this time.

892
01:01:29.541 --> 01:01:30.667
Any more questions?

893
01:01:31.209 --> 01:01:32.627
I'm never taking your class.

894
01:01:32.711 --> 01:01:34.337
Take it. I'll give you good grades.

895
01:01:34.421 --> 01:01:35.839
A monkey can't get good grades.

896
01:01:35.922 --> 01:01:38.091
All my students are monkeys anyway.

897
01:01:42.178 --> 01:01:43.972
Please keep today's chat between us.

898
01:01:44.055 --> 01:01:45.056
It's a secret.

899
01:01:45.140 --> 01:01:47.058
You're the one who blurted it all out.

900
01:01:47.809 --> 01:01:50.186
You saved my life, so I trusted you.

901
01:01:52.939 --> 01:01:54.149
I saved your life?

902
01:01:55.108 --> 01:01:56.359
Watch your mouth.

903
01:01:56.443 --> 01:01:58.486
Don't make me kill someone who saved my life.

904
01:01:59.154 --> 01:02:00.155
[♪ quirky music playing]

905
01:02:00.238 --> 01:02:02.198
[Jihoon] I don't think you're allowed to eat in here.

906
01:02:03.450 --> 01:02:06.661
[Youjin] Right. I'm not a student here.

907
01:02:08.830 --> 01:02:09.998
I'm a graduate.

908
01:02:10.957 --> 01:02:12.876
No one can hold my grades over my head

909
01:02:14.127 --> 01:02:16.921
or stop me from graduating, so I can do whatever I want.

910
01:02:18.548 --> 01:02:20.091
Do you really not remember me?

911
01:02:21.593 --> 01:02:22.635
What?

912
01:02:23.178 --> 01:02:24.304
Never mind. Forget it.

913
01:03:14.813 --> 01:03:15.980
[door lock chimes]

914
01:03:18.066 --> 01:03:21.653
[cellphone vibrating]

915
01:03:28.576 --> 01:03:29.577
[Youjin] Minjae.

916
01:03:32.205 --> 01:03:33.581
-Minjae. -What?

917
01:03:34.082 --> 01:03:35.625
What? What happened?

918
01:03:35.708 --> 01:03:37.335
I thought you were in the hospital.

919
01:03:37.919 --> 01:03:40.255
[Youjin] They don't keep you long after an appendectomy.

920
01:03:40.338 --> 01:03:42.257
Well, then you should be resting at home.

921
01:03:42.340 --> 01:03:43.466
What are you doing here?

922
01:03:44.592 --> 01:03:47.595
[Youjin] I have something to tell you, and something to show you.

923
01:03:48.638 --> 01:03:51.307
Really? Then can you wait here? I'll go grab my phone.

924
01:03:51.391 --> 01:03:53.893
Actually, I'd rather talk at your place.

925
01:03:53.977 --> 01:03:55.770
-[Minjae] What? -[Youjin] I have something to show you.

926
01:03:56.479 --> 01:03:58.356
You can show me right here. Let me see.

927
01:03:58.439 --> 01:03:59.482
I can't.

928
01:04:00.233 --> 01:04:01.484
Not in public.

929
01:04:02.360 --> 01:04:03.361
[Minjae] Why?

930
01:04:03.444 --> 01:04:04.445
I just can't.

931
01:04:05.572 --> 01:04:09.826
Uh, I don't know what it is, but I can't let you in right now.

932
01:04:10.910 --> 01:04:13.246
Just show me at school later. Bye.

933
01:04:13.329 --> 01:04:16.457
If you won't let me in, I'll just keep standing here.

934
01:04:17.083 --> 01:04:18.543
[Minjae] Okay, stand there forever then.

935
01:04:18.626 --> 01:04:20.086
-But... -[Minjae] Wait.

936
01:04:20.170 --> 01:04:21.880
How did you know where I live?

937
01:04:23.464 --> 01:04:25.300
I asked Kim Sejin.

938
01:04:26.968 --> 01:04:27.969
Kim Sejin?

939
01:04:32.182 --> 01:04:33.183
[Youjin] Why?

940
01:04:36.144 --> 01:04:37.395
[door lock beeps]

941
01:04:38.605 --> 01:04:39.647
[door lock chimes]

942
01:04:40.481 --> 01:04:41.482
Okay. Come in.

943
01:04:42.775 --> 01:04:43.776
Yeah.

944
01:04:47.572 --> 01:04:50.241
You can go and sit on the couch over there.

945
01:04:50.325 --> 01:04:51.326
[Youjin] Okay.

946
01:04:51.409 --> 01:04:52.827
[Minjae groaning] Just give me a second.

947
01:04:53.536 --> 01:04:54.537
[grunts]

948
01:04:56.789 --> 01:04:57.790
[door lock chimes]

949
01:05:05.715 --> 01:05:07.008
[grunts]

950
01:05:10.970 --> 01:05:11.971
Uh...

951
01:05:13.973 --> 01:05:18.436
By the way, I think water is all I've got.

952
01:05:18.519 --> 01:05:20.271
Do you want some? Is that okay?

953
01:05:20.355 --> 01:05:21.356
[Youjin] Yes.

954
01:05:24.651 --> 01:05:26.361
-[Minjae] Here. -Thank you.

955
01:05:29.155 --> 01:05:30.240
[Minjae groans softly]

956
01:05:35.328 --> 01:05:38.248
You said you had something to show me. So show me, then go.

957
01:05:52.220 --> 01:05:53.429
What are you doing?

958
01:05:53.513 --> 01:05:55.223
I need to take this off first.

959
01:05:55.306 --> 01:05:56.474
[Minjae] Take it off? Why?

960
01:05:56.557 --> 01:05:58.393
What are you doing? Are you out of your mind?

961
01:06:00.603 --> 01:06:02.855
Come on, look.

962
01:06:02.939 --> 01:06:04.315
Hey, Lim Youjin.

963
01:06:04.399 --> 01:06:06.985
This isn't going to work on me. I'm not giving in.

964
01:06:07.068 --> 01:06:08.194
Not a chance.

965
01:06:08.278 --> 01:06:10.530
Don't take your clothes off. Put them back on.

966
01:06:11.698 --> 01:06:14.075
[Youjin sighs, mumbles] Just look.

967
01:06:14.158 --> 01:06:16.411
No, I'm not looking.

968
01:06:17.412 --> 01:06:19.789
If you keep this up, I'm calling the cops, okay?

969
01:06:20.957 --> 01:06:22.959
Don't get the wrong idea. Just look.

970
01:06:23.042 --> 01:06:24.043
No.

971
01:06:24.127 --> 01:06:25.920
Look at where I had surgery.

972
01:06:35.888 --> 01:06:39.809
[Minjae] Hey, why are you taking that off? What if it gets infected? Put it back on.

973
01:06:41.060 --> 01:06:42.770
-[Youjin] Look at it. -[Minjae sighs wearily]

974
01:06:44.230 --> 01:06:48.401
I guess I can't wear a bikini anymore with this scar, right?

975
01:06:49.569 --> 01:06:50.903
[mumbling] What?

976
01:06:50.987 --> 01:06:52.447
You were going to wear a bikini?

977
01:06:52.530 --> 01:06:54.866
Guys all love bikinis, don't they?

978
01:06:55.992 --> 01:06:58.077
Hey, the bikini's not the problem.

979
01:06:58.161 --> 01:07:00.747
[groans] This... It must've hurt so much.

980
01:07:02.332 --> 01:07:03.916
[Youjin] The surgery didn't hurt.

981
01:07:04.000 --> 01:07:05.168
I was put under.

982
01:07:06.210 --> 01:07:09.172
It still hurts, even if they put you under. [groans]

983
01:07:11.007 --> 01:07:13.134
[Youjin] Now stop looking. I'm getting embarrassed.

984
01:07:13.676 --> 01:07:14.761
-[Minjae] Sorry. -[Youjin] Okay.

985
01:07:22.560 --> 01:07:25.688
Now that you've seen mine, show me yours too.

986
01:07:27.482 --> 01:07:28.483
What?

987
01:07:29.817 --> 01:07:32.070
Show me where they operated on your leg.

988
01:07:35.198 --> 01:07:36.616
You can't just look at mine.

989
01:07:37.241 --> 01:07:39.494
Show me yours too, so we're even.

990
01:07:39.994 --> 01:07:41.579
[Minjae sighs softly]

991
01:07:43.581 --> 01:07:44.832
Show me yours too.

992
01:07:46.709 --> 01:07:48.586
I'm not going home until you show me.

993
01:07:50.213 --> 01:07:51.255
Look at you.

994
01:07:58.471 --> 01:08:00.515
[scoffing] Jeez. Fine, look.

995
01:08:00.598 --> 01:08:02.934
I'll show you. Go on and look.

996
01:08:07.980 --> 01:08:09.023
[Minjae grunts]

997
01:08:20.910 --> 01:08:21.953
[Minjae sighs softly]

998
01:08:24.163 --> 01:08:25.164
Look.

999
01:08:31.170 --> 01:08:32.463
Can I touch it?

1000
01:08:32.964 --> 01:08:33.965
What?

1001
01:08:35.967 --> 01:08:36.968
You can touch it.

1002
01:08:39.762 --> 01:08:40.763
[Minjae gasps]

1003
01:08:40.847 --> 01:08:41.848
[Youjin] Did that hurt?

1004
01:08:42.598 --> 01:08:43.766
No, I'm just surprised.

1005
01:08:44.517 --> 01:08:45.726
It doesn't hurt anymore.

1006
01:08:47.353 --> 01:08:50.481
But it must've hurt a lot when you had the surgery.

1007
01:08:51.816 --> 01:08:53.401
It didn't hurt. I was put under.

1008
01:08:54.485 --> 01:08:55.528
That's a lie.

1009
01:08:56.779 --> 01:08:58.281
You think I'm an idiot?

1010
01:08:59.198 --> 01:09:01.617
Even a tiny paper cut hurts so much.

1011
01:09:02.785 --> 01:09:04.787
[♪ emotional music builds]

1012
01:09:06.330 --> 01:09:08.082
[softly] It must've hurt so much.

1013
01:09:09.667 --> 01:09:12.253
It must've hurt so much. [voice breaking] It must have...

1014
01:09:14.672 --> 01:09:17.633
[♪ emotional music playing]

1015
01:09:21.345 --> 01:09:22.930
[sobbing] It must've hurt so much.

1016
01:09:23.014 --> 01:09:24.807
[whimpering]

1017
01:09:26.309 --> 01:09:27.852
Hey, are you crying?

1018
01:09:29.395 --> 01:09:30.813
Hey, don't be like this.

1019
01:09:30.897 --> 01:09:31.898
Stand up.

1020
01:09:31.981 --> 01:09:34.275
[Youjin sobs] Why did you have to go and get sick like that?

1021
01:09:35.276 --> 01:09:37.236
Everyone else is doing just fine.

1022
01:09:37.737 --> 01:09:39.489
What makes you so special, huh?

1023
01:09:40.823 --> 01:09:43.326
Everyone else... Everyone else is perfectly healthy,

1024
01:09:43.409 --> 01:09:46.537
so why did you have to get a disease like that? Why?

1025
01:09:48.539 --> 01:09:50.791
[sobbing]

1026
01:09:52.960 --> 01:09:54.587
It must've hurt so much.

1027
01:09:56.255 --> 01:09:58.007
God, this is annoying.

1028
01:09:58.090 --> 01:09:59.801
This is annoying. [cries]

1029
01:10:01.302 --> 01:10:03.012
[sniffles] This is annoying...

1030
01:10:03.513 --> 01:10:04.514
[wails]

1031
01:10:04.597 --> 01:10:05.932
[softly] Don't cry. Don't be like this.

1032
01:10:06.015 --> 01:10:07.809
-Don't cry. Seriously. -[Youjin sobbing]

1033
01:10:11.771 --> 01:10:13.189
It hurt at the time.

1034
01:10:14.398 --> 01:10:17.777
But it's all healed now, and I'm fine. It doesn't hurt anymore.

1035
01:10:22.657 --> 01:10:25.451
[Youjin sobbing]

1036
01:10:25.535 --> 01:10:28.120
Stop and get up. Come on, get up.

1037
01:10:29.455 --> 01:10:31.457
[Youjin continues sobbing]

1038
01:10:33.417 --> 01:10:36.671
[loudly] Stop crying, for goodness' sake. You're driving me crazy! Okay?

1039
01:10:37.839 --> 01:10:39.215
Look at me. Open your eyes.

1040
01:10:40.383 --> 01:10:41.551
Look at me!

1041
01:10:44.470 --> 01:10:47.098
[softly] You need to look at me so I can talk, you know.

1042
01:10:47.974 --> 01:10:49.016
Look at me.

1043
01:10:52.770 --> 01:10:53.855
I'm okay now.

1044
01:10:56.732 --> 01:10:57.817
I'm not sick anymore.

1045
01:10:59.569 --> 01:11:00.778
I'm fine.

1046
01:11:06.701 --> 01:11:07.743
[Youjin sniffles]

1047
01:11:10.454 --> 01:11:12.456
[♪ music continues playing]

1048
01:12:00.087 --> 01:12:02.089
[♪ music fades]

1049
01:12:02.173 --> 01:12:06.093
BETWEEN STEPS

1050
01:12:06.636 --> 01:12:08.095
[Youjin] I love coming to school.

1051
01:12:08.179 --> 01:12:10.097
I always look forward to seeing you guys.

1052
01:12:10.932 --> 01:12:13.059
[Sejin] What was Lim Youjin doing at your place?

1053
01:12:13.142 --> 01:12:16.979
Things can get really messy in a lab when romance is involved.

1054
01:12:17.063 --> 01:12:19.732
I'll nip this in the bud before it causes any trouble.

1055
01:12:19.815 --> 01:12:20.983
Have you seen this?

1056
01:12:21.067 --> 01:12:23.194
Lim Youjin, why are you coming out so late?

1057
01:12:23.277 --> 01:12:25.112
It's not like you're never coming back.

1058
01:12:25.196 --> 01:12:26.739
I might never come back.

1059
01:12:27.323 --> 01:12:28.532
I won't come back.

1060
01:12:28.616 --> 01:12:30.034
[Youjin] You're such a coward.

1061
01:12:30.117 --> 01:12:32.119
Stay that way for the rest of your life.

1062
01:12:32.203 --> 01:12:34.205
[♪ theme song playing]
